<title>JAPAN: Takigami Steel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takigami Steel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.52		vs	   15.46</p>
<p> Operating	  361 million	 vs	    1.23</p>
<p> Current	    465 million	 vs	    1.40</p>
<p> Net		  258 million	 vs	  739 million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.30 yen	  vs	   40.73 yen</p>
<p> Shares		27 million	 vs	   18 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Takigami Steel Construction Co Ltd is a medium-scale specialised manufacturer of steelframes and bridges.</p>
